<title>UK: Eurofima ups 10-year bond to 600 mln Swiss francs.</title>
<headline>Eurofima ups 10-year bond to 600 mln Swiss francs.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eurofima has increased the following domestic bond issue to 600 million Swiss francs from 500 million francs, lead manager Credit Suisse said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The deal was launched Tuesday.</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN SFR   COUPON     4.00	MATURITY    30.APR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.20    PAY DATE    30.APR.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    EBS	 EOS	   15.APR.97</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5+MULT    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
